cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Annotated Danish Verse 1500–1700"
authors:
  - family-names: Nykrog
    given-names: Niels
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-09"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nielsnykrog/annotated-danish-verse-1500-1700"
abstract: "18 Danish-language verse texts (1529–1674) hand-annotated with syllable
  stress and metrical scansion: 1,805 verse lines, each syllable-stressed word
  marked with * and each line followed by its metrical pattern of + (stress) and
  - (non-stress). Intended for training and evaluating metrical scansion models
  on early modern Danish."
keywords:
  - Danish poetry
  - early modern
  - metrical scansion
  - prosody
  - stress annotation
  - dataset
  - computational poetics
